        "created_at": "2014-12-02T17:15:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is it still possible to get the promo pack for this game? Or if not, will the open sharing of promo graphics allowance from the card game apply to the minis game?</p><p>Honestly I won't be able to pick up the game until probably february at the earliest. Just wondering what the status of promos is as i know they did ship to retailers back in september. Didn't know if they are still around now.</p>",
